{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12205020.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12205020","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12205020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1220502001:0":{"text":"저기, 마을 주변에서 하얀 새끼 돼지를 본 적 있니?","source_cn":"小家伙，你们有没有在村子附近看到几只白净的小猪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FAF3850BABAC864","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1220502002:1":{"text":"새끼 돼지요?\n음… 아니요, 못 봤어요.","source_cn":"小猪？\\n唔……好像没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6069A9DCFF20EC29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220502003:0":{"text":"물귀신파가 도둑질한 건 아닐까요? 전에 혼란스러운 틈을 타 이것저것 많이 훔친 게 분명해요.","source_cn":"会不会是被水鬼帮掠走了？毕竟之前那么混乱，他们很可能趁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8521596FC79A257","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220502004:1":{"text":"내 생각에도 그놈들이야. 물귀신파 녀석들, 분명 그런 일을 저지르고도 남을 놈들이지!","source_cn":"我也是这么怀疑的。水鬼帮那群混蛋，绝对干得出来这种事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA14296983DE15A56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220502005:1":{"text":"예전에도 자주 우리 마을을 침범했어! 이번에 우리가 수적으로 불리하지만 않았다면… 사람들을 돌보느라 미처 가축을 신경 쓰지 못한 내가 잘못이지!","source_cn":"以前他们就经常跑来侵扰我们村子！这一次要不是他们人多势...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA087B1D3DFB13DFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220502006:1":{"text":"에휴, 됐다. 이 얘기는 그만두고, 오늘 반드시 놈들의 은신처를 찾아내서, 확 그냥… 아얏!","source_cn":"行了，我不和你们说了，我今天非得找到他们的老巢，把那里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFFBB76BC9D5B3B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220502007:1":{"text":"…세상에! 상처가 심해요. 가축을 찾는 것보다는 쉬는 게 우선이에요.","source_cn":"——呜哇！你也受了不轻的伤！还是好好休息，别激动比较好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEA2A68A955C30D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220502008:1":{"text":"그럴 순 없지! 물귀신파 녀석들을 족치진 못하더라도, 내 돼지들을 찾아야… 스읍…","source_cn":"那怎么行？！就算不教训水鬼帮，我也得去找我的那些猪——嘶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C1F70B12764D853","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220502009:1":{"text":"무리하지 마세요. 건강이 우선이에요.","source_cn":"建议你不要逞强，养好身体才是最重要的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B6A1281F0A044D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220502010:1":{"text":"돼지를 찾는 일이라면 저희가 도와드릴게요!","source_cn":"至于找猪这种小事，我们可以帮你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AAB5EC922E41030","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1220502011:1":{"text":"저… 정말 도와줄 거니? 물귀신파는 상대하기 쉽지 않은데...","source_cn":"这……你们真的愿意帮我？水鬼帮可不是好对付的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72163DE8B8F3573D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1220502011":{"text":"저… 정말 도와줄 거니? 물귀신파는 상대하기 쉽지 않은데...","source_cn":"这……你们真的愿意帮我？水鬼帮可不是好对付的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72163DE8B8F3573D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1220502012:1":{"text":"맞아요! 물귀신파가 마스터의 상대가 될 리가 없죠! 아주머니, 이 일은 우리에게 맡겨주세요!","source_cn":"就是！区区水鬼帮，怎么可能是主人的对手！大婶，你就把这...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAB8F5B3CF343A8E4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"맞아요! 물귀신파가 마스터의 상대가 될 리가 없죠! 아주머니, 이 일은 우리에게 맡겨주세요!","female":"맞아요! 물귀신파가 마스터의 상대가 될 리가 없죠! 아주머니, 이 일은 우리에게 맡겨주세요!","variant_male_record_index":"134347","variant_female_record_index":"134348","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1220502013:1":{"text":"그럼 부탁할게. <style=\"highlight\">남쪽의 산등성이</style>에 물귀신파의 영지가 있어. 아마 돼지를 거기로 데려갔을 거야.","source_cn":"那就麻烦你们了。<style=highlight>南边...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE53B3D53A604EAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1220502014:1":{"text":"돼지를 되찾아 와주기만 하면 돼. 놈들을 손봐주는 건 나중에 내가 직접 해도 되니까.","source_cn":"你们只要帮我把猪带回来就行，至于那群混蛋，我迟早要亲自...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99FFCFC72AA13E76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:0:1":{"text":"나한텐 누워서 떡 먹기지","source_cn":"小菜一碟","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x61C8A0E018A78388","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"나한텐 누워서 떡 먹기지","female":"나한텐 누워서 떡 먹기지","variant_male_record_index":"66278","variant_female_record_index":"66279","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:1:2":{"text":"전에 당신들을 구해준 게 나야","source_cn":"之前可是我救了你们","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6F42DF467C631AF7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"전에 당신들을 구해준 게 나야","female":"전에 당신들을 구해준 게 나야","variant_male_record_index":"66280","variant_female_record_index":"66281","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:提塔尼娅":{"text":"티타니아","source":"提塔尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12205030.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12205030","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12205030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1220503001:0":{"text":"마스터, 여기 돼지 발자국이 있어요. 흔적으로 봐서는 끌려간 것 같아요!","source_cn":"主人，这里有猪的脚印，而且像是被拖走的！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3C0F15511C7C81FB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 여기 돼지 발자국이 있어요. 흔적으로 봐서는 끌려간 것 같아요!","female":"마스터, 여기 돼지 발자국이 있어요. 흔적으로 봐서는 끌려간 것 같아요!","variant_male_record_index":"134351","variant_female_record_index":"134352","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1220503002:0":{"text":"흔적을 따라가면 돼지를 잡아간 물귀신파를 찾을 수 있을 거예요!","source_cn":"我们沿着痕迹向前，应该就能找到劫走它们的水鬼帮了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6CC160E3398521E9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"흔적을 따라가면 돼지를 잡아간 물귀신파를 찾을 수 있을 거예요!","female":"흔적을 따라가면 돼지를 잡아간 물귀신파를 찾을 수 있을 거예요!","variant_male_record_index":"134353","variant_female_record_index":"134354","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12205040.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12205040","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12205040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1220504001:0":{"text":"젠장! 이 돼지가 왜 이렇게 말을 안 듣는 거야!","source_cn":"这头猪也太倔了！根本控制不住！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75FFD6AF13975607","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:水鬼帮小喽啰":{"text":"물귀신파 졸개","source":"水鬼帮小喽啰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12205050.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12205050","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12205050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1220505001:0":{"text":"찾았다! 돼지를 도둑질한 건 역시 물귀신파의 짓이었어요!","source_cn":"找到了！村民丢失的猪果然是被水鬼帮掠走的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD287F71BF653A6D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1220505002:0":{"text":"그 과부들의 돼지 때문에 온 거냐? 몸 성히 돌아갈 생각은 안 하는 게 좋을 거야!","source_cn":"原来是来替那帮寡妇算账的啊……哼，既然来了就别想走了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x644358CEFA3F5923","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:水鬼帮小喽啰":{"text":"물귀신파 졸개","source":"水鬼帮小喽啰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12205080.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12205080","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12205080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1220508001:1":{"text":"큰일이야… 저 분노한 돼지가 다른 새끼 돼지들을 다 쫓아냈어!","source_cn":"完蛋了……那只发怒的猪把其它小猪都吓跑了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF50C2375B79172A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1220508002:1":{"text":"치피, 진정해! 돼지들이 마을 방향으로 도망간 것 같아.","source_cn":"先别紧张！看它们跑的方向，像是回村里去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4C9159B024B8CDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220508003:1":{"text":"치피, 저 돼지를 제압할 방법이 있어?","source_cn":"满满，你有办法制服这只大猪吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7729F981028A8876","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220508004:1":{"text":"에? 치피는 동물 길들이는 방법을 모른다구!","source_cn":"哎——？！可满满不会驯兽啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61C654BA495936F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220508005:1":{"text":"아니면 마을로 돌아가서 돼지 주인에게 뭔가 해결책이 있는지 물어볼까?","source_cn":"要不然，我们先回去问问它的主人有没有驯服的办法？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35424503A9BB06D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220508006:1":{"text":"그럴 수밖에… 그럼 치피가 여기서 저 돼지를 감시하고 있을 테니, 해미 너는 얼른 <style=\"highlight\">스몰워터 마을</style>로 돌아가서 방법을 찾아봐!","source_cn":"好像只能这样了……那满满留下来保护这只猪，免得它跑丢！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FA3741DD79300C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12205091.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12205091","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12205091","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1220509101:0":{"text":"역시 새끼 돼지들이 마을 쪽으로 도망갔어요!","source_cn":"果然，这些小猪都跑回村子里来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D0F5101A8ADF7B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1220509102:0":{"text":"엉망진창이군! 어서 날 도와 돼지들을 <style=\"highlight\">돼지우리에 몰아넣어 줘</style>!","source_cn":"真是乱了套了！快，快帮我把它们<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EDB1603A9E0F2F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:提塔尼娅":{"text":"티타니아","source":"提塔尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12205100.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12205100","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12205100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1220510001:1":{"text":"아휴, 이 녀석들 진짜 말썽이야! 고생 많았어.","source_cn":"唉，我家这些小猪崽，就是不让人省心！真是给你们添麻烦了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DFA3101C61DC9E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1220510002:1":{"text":"아주머니, 물귀신파 영지에 아직 돼지 한 마리가 남았는데, 그 녀석이 뭐 때문인지 화를 내고 있어서 가까이 갈 수가 없어요.","source_cn":"大婶，水鬼帮营地还有一只猪。但它一直在发怒，不肯让我们近身。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3710A42DD151526E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220510003:0":{"text":"오, 그 튼튼한 그 꼬마 녀석을 말하는 거구나! 어쩐지 안 보인다 했더니!","source_cn":"哦，你说的肯定是最健硕的那只小猪！我说怎么没看见它呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51779B16C720A833","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1220510003":{"text":"오, 그 튼튼한 그 꼬마 녀석을 말하는 거구나! 어쩐지 안 보인다 했더니!","source_cn":"哦，你说的肯定是最健硕的那只小猪！我说怎么没看见它呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51779B16C720A833","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220510006:2":{"text":"물론 있지! 집에 남편과 아들이 돼지를 길들일 때 쓰던 방울이 있어.","source_cn":"这事好办！我家有个铃铛，是以前我丈夫和儿子拿来训练小猪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAEA208B3AB84B1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220510007:1":{"text":"다만… 남편과 아들이 떠나고, 그때 기르던 돼지들도 그 꼬마 녀석밖에 남지 않았단다. 나머지 돼지들은 중에 기른 거야.","source_cn":"不过……唉，他们都离开好多年了。当时养的那些猪，也只剩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2D50C8BCAE4D163","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220510008:1":{"text":"문제는 그 방울을 오랫동안 쓰지 않아서, 지금 어디에 들어있는지 알 수가 없네. 당장 찾을 수도 없고.","source_cn":"那铃铛很久不用，我都忘记收到哪个包裹里了。现在想找出来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0F9EC52F1200AE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220510009:1":{"text":"괜찮다면 나랑 같이 방울을 찾아줄래?","source_cn":"你们要是不介意，就帮我一起找一下吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x789EFE22CD6FCE5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"…그걸 새끼 돼지라고 할 수 있을까?","source_cn":"……那还算是小猪吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1240C52D49799CAE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"…그걸 새끼 돼지라고 할 수 있을까?","female":"…그걸 새끼 돼지라고 할 수 있을까?","variant_male_record_index":"66282","variant_female_record_index":"66283","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220510004:0":{"text":"부르는 게 습관이 돼서… 호호. 왕년에 우리 남편이 기르던 돼지 중에 유일하게 남은 녀석이거든.","source_cn":"叫习惯了而已。当年我丈夫养的第一批小猪里，就只剩下这一只了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBFF8D6FD4D7D4642","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"부르는 게 습관이 돼서… 호호. 왕년에 우리 남편이 기르던 돼지 중에 유일하게 남은 녀석이거든.","female":"부르는 게 습관이 돼서… 호호. 왕년에 우리 남편이 기르던 돼지 중에 유일하게 남은 녀석이거든.","variant_male_record_index":"134374","variant_female_record_index":"134375","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220510005:0":{"text":"어쩐지 다른 새끼 돼지들보다 크다 싶었어요. 그래서 길들이는 방법이 없을까요?","source_cn":"难怪它的体型比其他小猪都要大呢。那有没有什么可以驯服它...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35D251CB22E1322D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:1:2":{"text":"달랠 방법이 없을까?","source_cn":"你有办法安抚它吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0632D7C932FEC2DF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"달랠 방법이 없을까?","female":"달랠 방법이 없을까?","variant_male_record_index":"66284","variant_female_record_index":"66285","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:提塔尼娅":{"text":"티타니아","source":"提塔尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12205110.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12205110","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12205110","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1220511001:0":{"text":"휴우~ 드디어 찾았어.","source_cn":"真不容易啊，可算把这铃铛又找出来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x122E022254A62753","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1220511002:0":{"text":"이제 이것만 있으면 괜찮아요! 금방 돼지를 데리고 올게요!","source_cn":"有了它就没问题了，我们很快就把你的猪带回来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68C203A86A609092","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:提塔尼娅":{"text":"티타니아","source":"提塔尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12205120.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12205120","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12205120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1220512001:0":{"text":"치피, 우리가 돼지를 길들이는 방울을 갖고 왔어.","source_cn":"满满，我们找到驯服大猪的铃铛啦~","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B0F5A0EEE0BA34E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1220512002:0":{"text":"다행이다! 얼른 이 녀석을 데려가! 저 녀석이 노려보는 데 무서워 죽겠다구!","source_cn":"太好了，我们快点送他回去吧！满满实在不想被它继续瞪着了……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9E8549F5A9E3FCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12205130.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12205130","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12205130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1220513001:1":{"text":"아주머니, 왜 마을 어귀까지 나와 계세요?","source_cn":"大婶，你怎么跑到村口来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19C4C8B728FC41ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1220513002:1":{"text":"그게 다 이 녀석의 고집 때문이지 뭐니! 마침 마을도 진정되었으니, 너희를 마중 나왔단다.","source_cn":"还不是因为这只猪脾气最倔！正好村里也安稳点了，我就想着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B57F4F9975FF36D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220513003:1":{"text":"돼지를 되찾아 주어서 고마워! 이제야 편히 쉴 수 있겠구나.","source_cn":"多谢你们帮我找回它！现在我总算能安心歇一会儿了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB395822808266040","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220513004:1":{"text":"아, 방울을 꼭 챙기세요!","source_cn":"啊，别忘记收好这个！你的铃铛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63A1631AA3E05D07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220513005:1":{"text":"아이고… 잘 챙길 테니 걱정하지 말렴. 어쨌든 이건 남편과 아들이 남긴 유품이니까…","source_cn":"哎……不用担心，我会好好收着它的。不管怎么说，也是我丈...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6870A87FF40162CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1220513005":{"text":"아이고… 잘 챙길 테니 걱정하지 말렴. 어쨌든 이건 남편과 아들이 남긴 유품이니까…","source_cn":"哎……不用担心，我会好好收着它的。不管怎么说，也是我丈夫和儿子留下来的遗物……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6870A87FF40162CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220513006:1":{"text":"…벌써 몇 년이나 지났는데, 이젠 괜찮단다.","source_cn":"……都过去多少年了，我早就没事了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE08459620F8E6B70","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"…벌써 몇 년이나 지났는데, 이젠 괜찮단다.","female":"…벌써 몇 년이나 지났는데, 이젠 괜찮단다.","variant_male_record_index":"134390","variant_female_record_index":"134391","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220513007:1":{"text":"게다가 우리와 같이 바닷가에 사는 사람들은 언젠가 이런 날이 올 거라는 걸 예상하고 있거든.","source_cn":"再说了，我们这种靠海吃饭的人，早就知道会有这么一天。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB72932EEF6B0BAC4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"게다가 우리와 같이 바닷가에 사는 사람들은 언젠가 이런 날이 올 거라는 걸 예상하고 있거든.","female":"게다가 우리와 같이 바닷가에 사는 사람들은 언젠가 이런 날이 올 거라는 걸 예상하고 있거든.","variant_male_record_index":"134392","variant_female_record_index":"134393","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220513009:1":{"text":"죄송해요. 상처를 드리려는 건 아니었어요…","source_cn":"抱歉，我们不是故意惹你伤心的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB3D732CE7500DAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220513010:1":{"text":"죄, 죄송해요! 치피는 이게 이렇게 중요한 방울인지도 모르고…","source_cn":"对、对不起！满满也不知道，这个铃铛对你这么重要……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BB785A67828FD5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1220513011:1":{"text":"자자, 너무 신경 쓰지 말렴! 난 이미 현실을 받아들였단다!","source_cn":"行了，别往心里去！我早就接受现实了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC937BB1AEA474516","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1220513012:1":{"text":"그냥 가끔, 아주 가끔… 그들이 보고 싶을 뿐이야.","source_cn":"只不过，偶尔，很偶尔的时候……我还是会想他们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6D009CF2B8A517C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"너무 상심하지 마","source_cn":"节哀","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5510FE2CC752FCD0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"너